OL,3,AParliament restoration delays
OL,4,A'frustrating', says Commons Speaker
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Speaker of the House of Commons has
OL,7,Fexpressed "frustration" with the lack
OL,8,Fof progress on restoration to protect
OL,9,Fthe Palace of Westminster.
OL,11,FSir Lindsay Hoyle told the BBC the
OL,12,Fcurrent process for approving essential
OL,13,Frenovations to Parliament amounted to
OL,14,F"putting ourselves in handcuffs", and
OL,15,Fsaid more time was spent "doing
OL,16,Fsurveys" than getting repairs under
OL,17,Fway.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
