OL,3,AParliament restoration delays
OL,4,A'frustrating', says Commons Speaker
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Commons public accounts committee
OL,7,Fthis week warned it was "crunch time"
OL,8,Ffor the ailing building's restoration,
OL,9,Fwhich could cost up to #40bn and take
OL,10,F61 years.
OL,12,FIt said every additional year of delay
OL,13,Fcost taxpayers #420m, while its
OL,14,Fchairman warned the Palace could be
OL,15,Fleft vulnerable to a devastating fire
OL,16,Flike that which engulfed the Notre
OL,17,FDame.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
